{"id":"ab4b1709840d87d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-cor-ito-drift.md","title":"Itô Drift-Diffusion Process","display":"cor-ito-drift — Itô Drift-Diffusion Process","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-ito-drift","aliases":["58-cor-ito-drift"],"display":"cor-ito-drift — Itô Drift-Diffusion Process","depends_on":["[[58-df-sde]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-ito-drift"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-ito-drift</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ito-drift — Itô Drift-Diffusion Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"21aa705043d57f18\" href=\"?note=21aa705043d57f18\" title=\"58-df-sde\">58-df-sde</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(d,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P,X,B,X_0\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P,X,B,X_0\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d\\land\\sigma:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}\">\\(b:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d\\land\\sigma:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times m}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SDESolution}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{SDESolution}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"21aa705043d57f18\" href=\"?note=21aa705043d57f18\" title=\"58-df-sde\">58-df-sde</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ito\\text{-}drift} \\vdash \\mathrm{SDESolution}_S(X,b,\\sigma,B,X_0,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P)\\to\\exists!L\\in\\left((\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^d})^{C^2(\\mathbb R^d)}\\right)^{\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in C^2(\\mathbb R^d)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^d\\;\\left(L(t)(f)(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^{d}b_i(t,x)\\,\\partial_i f(x)+\\frac12\\sum_{i=1}^{d}\\sum_{j=1}^{d}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{m}\\sigma_{ik}(t,x)\\sigma_{jk}(t,x)\\right)\\partial_{ij}f(x)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ito\\text{-}drift} \\vdash \\mathrm{SDESolution}_S(X,b,\\sigma,B,X_0,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb F,\\mathbb P)\\to\\exists!L\\in\\left((\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R^d})^{C^2(\\mathbb R^d)}\\right)^{\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}}\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall f\\in C^2(\\mathbb R^d)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^d\\;\\left(L(t)(f)(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^{d}b_i(t,x)\\,\\partial_i f(x)+\\frac12\\sum_{i=1}^{d}\\sum_{j=1}^{d}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{m}\\sigma_{ik}(t,x)\\sigma_{jk}(t,x)\\right)\\partial_{ij}f(x)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The second-order coefficient at time <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(t,x)\\sigma(t,x)^{\\mathsf T}\">\\(\\sigma(t,x)\\sigma(t,x)^{\\mathsf T}\\)</span>; the scalar <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^2\\Delta f/2\">\\(\\sigma^2\\Delta f/2\\)</span> form is only the isotropic special case.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sde","status":"resolved","id":"21aa705043d57f18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locatio